- `SLAB_COUNT = sizeof(m_l3_pgtable) / RV_MMU_PAGE_SIZE` — number of 4KB slabs available for L3 page tables.

So `m_l3_pgtable` is an array of 1024 × 4KB = 4MB worth of L3 page table entries. This gives `SLAB_COUNT = 1024` slabs of 4KB each.

